2:T498,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa","headline":"Voice of Santa for BBC Radio 2","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Guy Harris","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceoverguy","image":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/images/guy-harris-profile.jpg"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VoiceoverGuy","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.webp"}},"inLanguage":"en-GB","isAccessibleForFree":true,"description":"BBC Radio 2 Voice of Santa. In the Air and On the Air for Zoe Ball and the team at Christmas. Father Christmas even chats with Zoe on Christmas Eve.","datePublished":"2024-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","dateModified":"2024-12-01T00:00:00+00:00","keywords":["Father Christmas radio presenter zoe ball"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/img/blog/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa.jpg"}}4:T433,<h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: #AD030C;">Bring the Voice of Santa to Your Project</h2>

<p style="font-size: 18px;">
If you have a script that needs a Father Christmas, let me bring it to life! Whether it’s for radio, television, web, YouTube, or even a personalised Santa message, I can help.<br>
Ho Ho Ho! <a href="mailto:santa@voiceoverguy.co.uk" style="color: #0073e6;">Click here to get in touch</a> with your details, and I’ll provide an accurate quote tailored to your project.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 18px;">
Looking for something more personal? Create a <a href="https://festivestudio.com/store/santa-radio" target="_blank" style="color: #0073e6;" rel="noopener noreferrer">personalised audio message</a> or a magical <a href="https://festivestudio.com/i/santaradio/personalised-video" target="_blank" style="color: #0073e6;" rel="noopener noreferrer">video message from Santa</a> for your loved ones.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 18px;">
Santa will respond as quickly as he delivers gifts around the world, usually in less than 2 hours!
</p>
